<section id="story" class="story section-space" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <h2 id="story-title" class="editorial-title" data-reveal>
    Our story began not at the university we both graduated from,<br class="story-heading-break" />
    <em>but in an unfamiliar city we now call home.</em>
  </h2>
  <div class="story-grid">
    <div class="story-copy">
      <h3 class="story-stage">How we met</h3>
      <p>VIT-AP University, still pretty small when we were there, makes it all the more surprising that our paths never crossed. Having a few mutual friends didn’t help our case either. While he was busy bunking classes and sleeping in the hostel, she spent hours in classrooms and dance sessions. So, perhaps it wasn’t all that surprising that they never met.</p>
      <p>Then, freshly graduated and stepping into the world beyond university, we both found ourselves in the same city: Bangalore. This time, our mutual friends came to the rescue, and our paths finally crossed.</p>
    </div>
    <div
      class="paths"
      data-path-scene
      aria-label="From Aliganj and Rourkela, our paths met in Bangalore"
    >
      <div class="path-origins">
        <span>ALIGANJ<small>Swarnimam</small> </span>
        <span>ROURKELA<small>Plabini</small> </span>
      </div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 400 240" fill="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path
