        <circle cx="200" cy="230" r="5"></circle>
      </svg>
      <p>BANGALORE<small>Where our story began.</small></p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="city-scene" data-scroll-scene>
    <h3 class="city-type"><span>The journey.</span></h3>
    <p class="city-caption">She found his dark sense of humour hilarious; he found her scary laugh charming. Watching movies, exploring the city, trying out every food joint we could find, and dancing to Bollywood songs nobody else seemed to know soon became part of our routine.</p>
    <p class="city-caption">What neither of us expected was just how close we would become. He tolerates Taylor, and she vibes to Diljit. Before long, life without each other was hard to imagine.</p>
